    <string name="stopwatch_tips_body">1. The bottom buttons are in two rows: Reset, Pause all, and Resume all on top, New stopwatch below.\n2. By default a new stopwatch starts counting immediately; you can turn that off in settings so new ones wait at 0:00 until you start them.\n3. Tap a card title to rename it.\n4. Tap the time on a card to expand that stopwatch with lap timing; the page title is the stopwatch name and you can tap it to rename; the round button on the right pauses or resumes it.\n5. Timing is saved automatically. Closing the app does not stop the timers and uses no background resources.\n6. With the ongoing notification on, running timers show in the notification shade — tap it to come back here.</string>
