    <string name="changelog_title_desc">See what changed in each version, newest first. Long-press to copy.</string>
    <string name="changelog_version_format">v%1$s · %2$s</string>
    <string name="changelog_copied">Copied to clipboard</string>
    <string name="changelog_2_0_13_body">· Rebuilt the Date Calculator around one sentence — "from X to Y", or "from X, N days before/after" — with the two modes switched at the top of the page\n· Added a quick-fill date bar beside the date fields: tap a field and it pops up, so you no longer have to type eight digits\n· The quick-fill bar now chains: tapping a chip leaves it open and the next chip counts from the date you just set, so repeated taps walk the date forward or back\n· Added appear and dismiss transitions to the quick-fill bar and to the Home screen elements\n· The result is now large and centred, with a weeks-and-days breakdown underneath\n· Changing a date now clears the previous result instead of leaving a stale answer on screen\n· Fixed incomplete years being accepted as valid dates (e.g. "Oct 6, 202" was read as the year 202 and produced an absurd day count)\n· Fixed several plural forms in the English UI (1 day left / 1 lap / 1 stopwatch running, and more)</string>
    <string name="changelog_2_0_12_body">· Long-press a favorites icon or tile to enter edit mode directly\n· Fixed the edit entry sometimes triggering an unwanted ripple; its press ripple effect has been removed</string>
    <string name="changelog_2_0_11_body">· Widgets center now hints that some launchers block in-app pinning of widgets and shortcuts — widgets can still be added manually from the home screen\n· Stopwatch bottom buttons rearranged into two rows, fixing truncated labels\n· The Focus timer page now titles itself with the stopwatch name; tap the title to rename it\n· Redesigned the Favorites edit entry: hidden by default, it fades in when you tap an empty spot on Home and fades away after 3 idle seconds; Add app is now a ＋ tile while editing\n· Fixed stopwatch laps possibly bleeding into other stopwatches (data format upgraded, existing data migrates automatically)\n· Corrected a series of time-conversion units (microseconds and more)\n· Fixed the add entry disappearing after clearing all favorites</string>
    <string name="changelog_2_0_10_body">· New on Home: Favorites — one-tap access to your most-used features, with editing, drag-to-reorder, and vertical paging\n· New Widgets center: add app shortcuts and home-screen widgets to your launcher, with a live preview before placing\n· New anniversary widget: keep an eye on a countdown right from your home screen\n· Export/Import upgraded: everything (timing records, anniversaries, settings) is packed into one zip backup that can be fully restored\n· The stopwatch "Pause all" and "Resume all" are now two separate buttons\n· New setting "Start new stopwatches automatically" — new stopwatches can wait at 0:00 until you start them\n· New Changelog page (this one)\n· Various fixes and polish</string>

